    "The full Transformer triptych remains visibly different from the dedicated reference: generic internal paths, cross-region wires and visual hierarchy are still dense. Two local groups do not establish overall convergence.",
    "All 30 native SVG panels have 1082 node texts and 48 port texts inside their corresponding shapes. This does not establish whole-model readability or thousands-node performance.",
    "Actual editor import, checkbox, inspector, double-click expansion/refolding, save/reopen, raw source view and return were exercised. Transformer UI export matches the independently audited formal SVG. An oversized routed document was rejected by the existing 20MB limit; the same schema/IR/state-only document was then imported successfully."
